gpodder-leste (4.17.2+leste2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Playback as music: the launcher sets PulseAudio's media.role=music
    (PULSE_PROP), which the player's stream takes from its client, so that
    a deep-buffer music sink (the F(x)tec Pro1X's pro1x-music-sink, by its
    intended roles) plays podcasts with fewer wake-ups. QtMultimedia's
    MediaPlayer set no role.

 -- Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 11:20:00 +0100

gpodder-leste (4.17.2+leste1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * gPodder for Maemo Leste: gpodder-core 4.17.2, podcastparser and minidb
    with the Python bridge of gPodder for Sailfish OS 4.18.1, and the touch
    QML UI of gpodder-ui-qml.

